permissions-tab-clan = Clan
permissions-title = Permissions for { $group }
permissions-manage = Manage permissions
permissions-select-resource = Select a folder, map or package to manage this group's permissions.
permissions-other-maps = Maps outside the listed folders
permissions-owners-implicit = Clan owners have full permission clan-wide, except to member-owned maps and member-owned secrets.
permissions-folder-inheritance = These permissions cover this folder and its current and future clan-owned maps. Member-owned maps keep their own access rules.
permissions-direct-note = Permissions from other grants remain in effect until changed at their source. Direct permissions here can add access; they cannot deny inherited access.
permissions-inherited = Also granted through { $scope }: { $permissions }.
permissions-edit-origin = Edit the original grant
permissions-delegation-title = Permissions this group may give others
permissions-delegation-help = Choose what members may grant on this resource. Their grants stay within these limits and end with their delegation. Managing access does not itself allow reading or editing content.
